{"product_id":"matcha-stick-storage-cannister","title":"Matcha Stick Storage Cannister","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"643\"\u003eStore your bio matcha sticks in a decorative canister inspired by the Japanese art of \u003cstrong data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"450\"\u003eKintsugi\u003c\/strong\u003e — the craft of repairing broken ceramics with gold or platinum. Rather than hiding imperfections, Kintsugi celebrates the beauty in repair, honoring each crack as part of the object’s story.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"849\"\u003eKeep this canister in your home as a daily reminder of that philosophy. Like \u003cstrong data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"735\"\u003ewabi-sabi\u003c\/strong\u003e, it embodies the grace of imperfection — a quiet appreciation for life’s transient, beautifully flawed moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Gozen Bio Matcha","offers":[{"title":"10 \/ 10 \/ 10","offer_id":51228646703396,"sku":null,"price":99.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0963\/6282\/3972\/files\/2.png?v=1761573585","url":"https:\/\/gozenbiomatcha.com\/products\/matcha-stick-storage-cannister","provider":"Gozen Bio Matcha","version":"1.0","type":"link"}